## Key Concepts
- CKNE-to-throughput mapping
- Token-bucket style throttling
- Per-tenant fairness and SLA guarantees
- Telemetry-driven test strategy

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode: compute allocations per tenant each minute
function allocate(tenants, baseRate) {
  return tenants.map(t => {
    const rate = baseRate * (0.5 + 0.5 * t.ckne);
    return {tenant: t.id, rate};
  });
}
```

